        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9010P, Ultima Rectangular Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rectangular Door Pull is a favorite among designers for its sleek look and high-quality construction. This Ultima Rectangular Pull is available in several modern finish colors. Choose from 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Rectangular Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9010P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9010P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9010P Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-modern-rectangular-door-pull-set-omnia-btb-9010p\"><b>Back to Back Mounted Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
